#: ../../pyvista/CONTRIBUTING.rst:1947
msgid ""
"PyVista uses a high availability Linux cluster running "
"[k3s](https://k3s.io/) and deployed using "
"[Ansible](https://docs.ansible.com/). See [pyvista/arc-"
"runners](https://github.com/pyvista/arc-runners) for more details."
